<title>HONG KONG: Trading of Vanda Systems shares suspended.</title>
<headline>Trading of Vanda Systems shares suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of Vanda Systems &amp; Communications Holdings Ltd was suspended at the company's request pending an announcement, the Hong Kong Stock Exchange said on Tuesday.</p>
</text>
